i-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14c164b33a41fb16342c4f1f832aa0a6 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "ねぇ...私の事...好きだよねぇ...ねぇ...ねぇねぇねぇ...そんなに私が怖いの?...怖がる顔も好きだよ...私は貴方をこんなに愛してるの...で...貴方は...私の事を愛してる？...え...き...らい？...ふっ...ふふ...貴方は私のものだから...私は貴方を逃がさない...フフフｯ...そう貴方は永遠に...私の...モ...ノ..", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kuu_shiratori/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cc284da1f1e967245db008d329347e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cc284da1f1e967245db008d329347e4, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=891246b16dab6550fe0e85217760344a 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14c164b33a41fb16342c4f1f832aa0a6 3x", "genre": "voice", "nsfw": false, "body": "1、2、3、4、5、6、7、8\n2、2、3、4、5、6、7、8ラジオ体操の掛け声を元気よくおねがいします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kuu_shiratori/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cc284da1f1e967245db008d329347e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1328486549009223681%2FMBl8si-r.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cc284da1f1e967245db008d